==Battleground==
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bang-Bang]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 5.33~6.67 seconds<sup>160f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16 seconds<sup>400f~480f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Try to spawn quick meatshields so your attackers can stay there unharmed. You will also need long ranged units for Bang-Bang and Melee units for the peons.

